      "start_seconds": 1.01,
      "end_seconds": 4.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "Sorry I'm a little late, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 4.71,
      "end_seconds": 8.99,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "Of course, leave it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.96,
      "end_seconds": 20.97,
      "duration_seconds": 6.01,
      "text": "it's very heavy periods i thought I'd wait, but it hasn't gone"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.2,
      "end_seconds": 27.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "Did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 28.15,
      "end_seconds": 36.48,
      "duration_seconds": 8.33,
      "text": "yeah, for six months, I'd say it's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.07,
      "end_seconds": 39.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "What eases it, if anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 41.08,
      "end_seconds": 45.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.88,
      "text": "Double protection helps a bit. I've also been feeling exhausted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 47.05,
      "end_seconds": 50.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "And what about pain, fainting or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 52.51,
      "end_seconds": 57.52,
      "duration_seconds": 5.01,
      "text": "No pain, fainting or weight loss, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.59,
      "end_seconds": 63.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "right, any muscle or joint problems besides this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.59,
      "end_seconds": 67.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "Nothing else aches."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 69.19,
      "end_seconds": 73.33,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 73.84,
      "end_seconds": 82.78,
      "duration_seconds": 8.94,
      "text": "I'm on naproxen, 250 milligrams, twice a day. I'm on losartan, 50 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.63,
      "end_seconds": 87.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.56,
      "end_seconds": 97.93,
      "duration_seconds": 10.37,
      "text": "No, I share a house with my brother. I walk the dog every morning. I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.49,
      "end_seconds": 107.86,
      "duration_seconds": 8.37,
      "text": "Do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.84,
      "end_seconds": 111.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "I've never had an allergy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.34,
      "end_seconds": 116.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "Alright, what about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.81,
      "end_seconds": 121.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "Arthritis in my knees, for five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.46,
      "end_seconds": 123.31,
      "duration_seconds": 0.85,
      "text": "I follow"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.41,
      "end_seconds": 127.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "High blood pressure, for nearly five years"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.43,
      "end_seconds": 131.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "And And besides that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.76,
      "end_seconds": 140.81,
      "duration_seconds": 8.05,
      "text": "Right, so arthritis in your knees is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 159.3,
      "end_seconds": 161.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.04,
      "end_seconds": 167.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "No, I've never been operated on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.4,
      "end_seconds": 180.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Shall I check your blood pressure and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.93,
      "end_seconds": 190.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.92,
      "end_seconds": 212.03,
      "duration_seconds": 8.11,
      "text": "okay: heart rate 106, oxygen saturation is 96 percent, blood pressure 122 over 80. And temp 36.9 degrees"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 213.25,
      "end_seconds": 215.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "Right, is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.94,
      "end_seconds": 220.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "That's fine, I'll explain it soon."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.32,
      "end_seconds": 223.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "May I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.72,
      "end_seconds": 227.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "I'll listen to your chest now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.8,
      "end_seconds": 243.6,
      "duration_seconds": 4.8,
      "text": "Your inner eyelids are pale and your pulse is a little fast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.25,
      "end_seconds": 248.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Okay, that's enough for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.42,
      "end_seconds": 284.37,
      "duration_seconds": 16.95,
      "text": "So, based on the history and the examination, this looks most like heavy periods with iron deficiency. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more. I can't rule out fibroids yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 286.25,
      "end_seconds": 290.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "Oh, I'm scared it's something bad. Is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.15,
      "end_seconds": 305.92,
      "duration_seconds": 13.77,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with heavy periods with iron deficiency do well once it's treated properly. A pelvic ultrasound is what I'd like next, for heavy periods."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 309.75,
      "end_seconds": 312.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "okay, I'll do it it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 313.78,
      "end_seconds": 338.08,
      "duration_seconds": 24.3,
      "text": "I'll request a blood count, it'll help with heavy periods. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed. For this, ferrous sulfate, 200 milligrams, once a day, three months. It's for iron deficiency. Keep a pad count diary. I'll want another look after the results. Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 339.36,
      "end_seconds": 343.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "okay, that makes sense thanks for explaining"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 343.86,
      "end_seconds": 345.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "all the best"
    }
  ]
}